    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that resilience feels like a joke. like im just delaying the inevitable. if the biology is already set, then all this effort to \"be better\" is just prolonging the pain. its like trying to stop a storm that's already been mapped out. doesnt it feel kinda weird to fight something that is literally part of who you are?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
